Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:01.60,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}ШЕСТЬ ЛЕТ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.54,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}ЗА ШАУРМУ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.49,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Витёк, коротко. Карту нашёл?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:06.49,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Нашёл.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:07.44,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Потратил?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:08.29,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Чуть-чуть.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.39,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Сколько?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:10.79,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Триста сорок семь.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:11.64,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}На что?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:12.64,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Шаурма.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.34,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Всё?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:14.24,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Всё.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:15.24,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Красава.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:16.94,L,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Пять минут — и домой.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.54,J,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Кража с банковского счёта.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.44,J,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Тяжкое. До шести лет.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:22.19,V,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Ты, блин, сказал пять минут!
